### ============================================================================
### Enterprise Knowledge Management Platform — Demo API Collection (Milestone 6)
### Owner: Ayushi (Backend & Security)
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080
### ============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Login as Hannah (HR Employee) -> receives JWT with allowedDepartments: [HR, GENERAL]
# @name loginHr
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "hannah.hr@helios.example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 2. Get Current User Profile & Effective Permissions
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginHr.response.body.accessToken}}

### 3. List All Enterprise Departments
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/departments
Authorization: Bearer {{loginHr.response.body.accessToken}}

### 4. List Documents Visible to Caller (HR + GENERAL only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/documents?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{loginHr.response.body.accessToken}}

### 5. Hybrid Search (Semantic + Keyword) Scoped to Allowed Departments
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/search
Authorization: Bearer {{loginHr.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "How many unused PTO days can I carry over into next year?",
  "mode": "HYBRID",
  "topK": 5
}

### 6. Grounded RAG Chat with Source Citations (Non-Streaming)
# @name askChat
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{loginHr.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "How long is paid parental leave and when do employees become eligible?"
}

### 7. Grounded RAG Chat (Server-Sent Events Stream: meta -> token* -> citations -> done)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{loginHr.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: text/event-stream

{
  "message": "How much PTO does someone with 4 years of service accrue per month?"
}

### 8. Submit Thumbs-Up Feedback on Assistant Answer
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/chat/messages/{{askChat.response.body.messageId}}/feedback
Authorization: Bearer {{loginHr.response.body.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": "UP",
  "comment": "Exact policy citation from HR-001 page 2!"
}

### 9. Login as Alice (System Admin) -> Admin Analytics & Knowledge Gaps
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice.admin@helios.example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

### 10. Admin Analytics Summary KPI Tiles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/analytics/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 11. Admin Knowledge Gaps List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/knowledge-gaps?status=OPEN
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

### 12. Admin Audit Trail
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/audit-logs?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

